---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Services" description="Raw material sourcing, price negotiation, DRAP regulatory documentation, supplier identification, shipment coordination and after-sales support." page="services">
  <section class="ph navy">
    <div class="lat"><svg><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#hx)"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crumb fi"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Services</span></div>
      <h1 class="split">Six services. One procurement cycle.</h1>
      <p class="lead fi" style="--d:600ms">Use us end to end, or only for the part of sourcing that is holding your production back.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap acc" id="acc">
      <div class="acc-i open" data-r><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 1.8 3h10.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.8-3l-5-9V3M7.5 15h9"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">Raw material sourcing</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>We help pharmaceutical companies source premium-quality raw materials, excipients and packaging from reliable, globally trusted manufacturers, for a consistent supply that meets strict industry requirements.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>A qualified source and a comparable quotation.</p></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="acc-i" data-r style="--rd:60ms"><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8M14 7h7v7"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">Competitive price negotiation</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>We negotiate with suppliers on your behalf to secure competitive pricing and favourable commercial terms. Our industry knowledge and supplier connections keep costs down without compromising on quality.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>Agreed price, payment terms and Incoterms.</p></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="acc-i" data-r style="--rd:120ms"><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9zM14 3v6h6M8 14l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">Regulatory documentation</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>We prepare complete, well-structured documentation that complies with pharmaceutical standards and DRAP requirements, so you reach compliance smoothly and avoid unnecessary delays.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>A DRAP-ready import file.</p></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="acc-i" data-r style="--rd:180ms"><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">Supplier identification</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>To keep up with changing demand, we continuously explore and evaluate new qualified suppliers, giving you reliable sourcing options and a diversified supplier network.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>Alternative sources on file for critical materials.</p></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="acc-i" data-r style="--rd:240ms"><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 15h18l-2 5H5zM6 15V9h7v6M13 11h4l2 4"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">Shipment coordination</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>We manage shipments from the loading port to the final destination with full transparency, and keep you updated on status for better planning.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>Tracked port-to-plant delivery.</p></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="acc-i" data-r style="--rd:300ms"><button class="acc-h" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14v-3a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v3"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1"/></svg></span><span class="acc-t">After-sales support</span><span class="acc-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc-p"><div><div class="acc-in"><p>Our responsibility extends beyond delivery. We stay available for any query or concern, and build long-term, trustworthy relationships with our clients.</p><p class="got"><b>You get</b>One contact for every follow-up and reorder.</p></div></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec ice">
    <div class="wrap docs">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:18px;align-content:start"><h2 data-r>What arrives with every consignment.</h2><p class="muted" data-r style="--rd:100ms;font-size:.98rem">Your QA team receives the complete file before the material is released.</p></div>
      <ul>
        <li data-r><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>Certificate of Analysis</b><span>Batch results against the pharmacopoeial specification</span></div></li>
        <li data-r style="--rd:80ms"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>GMP certificate</b><span>Confirms the production site meets good manufacturing practice</span></div></li>
        <li data-r style="--rd:160ms"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>Drug Master File (open part)</b><span>Supports your product registration</span></div></li>
        <li data-r style="--rd:240ms"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>MSDS / SDS</b><span>Handling, storage and safety data</span></div></li>
        <li data-r style="--rd:320ms"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>Invoice &amp; packing list</b><span>For customs clearance and DRAP import documentation</span></div></li>
        <li data-r style="--rd:400ms"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9.5l3.2 3L14 5.5"/></svg></span><div><b>Certificate of origin &amp; bill of lading</b><span>Origin proof and shipment tracking</span></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec bigcta">
    <div class="wrap"><h2 data-r>Partner with us to streamline sourcing.</h2>
      <a class="ring mag" href="/contact/" aria-label="Start an enquiry" data-r style="--rd:150ms"><svg class="txt" viewBox="0 0 190 190" aria-hidden="true"><text><textPath href="#cp">START AN ENQUIRY · START AN ENQUIRY · </textPath></text></svg><span class="core"><svg><use href="#arr"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
